##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.1
##Scene A small fire Blender simulated, read from blender_fire.vdb, glowing by blackbody's colour of its flame over a dark floor under a faint dome
version 3.03
Format 96 64 1
PixelSamples 6 6
Projection "perspective" "fov" [40]
Clipping 0.01 100
Translate 0 0 5
Rotate -15 1 0 0
WorldBegin
Light "PxrDomeLight" "sky" "float intensity" [0.02]
AttributeBegin
Bxdf "ND_open_pbr_surface_surfaceshader" "floor" "color base_color" [0.4 0.4 0.4] "float specular_roughness" [0.5]
Polygon "P" [-4 -1 -3  4 -1 -3  4 -1 3  -4 -1 3]
AttributeEnd
# Blender's grid is z up and its fire stands over (0.94, 0.94), so it is turned y up and centred.
# volumes-fire.mtlx gives its smoke and its glow
AttributeBegin
Translate 0 -1 0
Scale 1.4 1.4 1.4
Rotate -90 1 0 0
Translate -0.94 -0.94 0
Bxdf "materialx" "fire" "string file" ["data/volumes-fire.mtlx"] "string material" ["burning"]
Volume "blobbydso:impl_openvdb" [0 2 0 2 0 2] [0 0 0] "constant string[2] blobbydso:stringargs" ["data/blender_fire.vdb" "density:fogvolume"] "varying float flame" []
AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
